{"id":939301,"title":"05｜推荐系统的GPT3时刻（上）：SasRec","content":"SASREC是生成式推荐系统中的基础算法，全称Self-Attentive Sequential Recommendation。它基于Transformer结构，通过自注意力机制处理用户行为序列，预测下一个交互项。SASREC模型将item ID映射为embedding，并结合位置编码作为输入，使用多层Transformer块进行处理。为了防止过拟合，模型在Attention输出、FFN输出及embedding上增加了Dropout Layer。SASREC采用单向注意力机制，确保未来信息不泄露给当前时刻。训练时，模型支持自回归建模和数据切分两种模式，后者通过均匀分布的loss值提高训练稳定性但会增加样本数量。在线推理中，SASREC可视为一种召回方法，利用双塔结构计算用户与物品的相关度，评估指标包括Hit@k和NDCG@k。实验表明，SASREC在多个数据集上的表现优于传统RNN方法，特别是在稀疏数据集上优势明显。此外，SASREC展示了类似大语言模型的Scaling Law特性，即随着模型规模增大，性能提升。注意力可视化分析揭示了模型学习到的时间相关性，进一步验证了序列推荐与语言生成之间的相似性。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":404963,"user_name":"骏影空尘","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4459709,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"E8ACF8E034EC6C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/44/0c/bd/fea103e0.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1769502399,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":147629,"content":"根据SASREC的论文，他们不是在全部item库上面算Hit，而是为每个正样本配100个随机采样的负样本，所以看起来数字会很高。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":4424762,"ctime":1770641965,"ip_address":"新加坡","comment_id":404963,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101108201,"comment_content":"想问一下sasrec的hit@10指标是在多少个样本里面把目标物品排进前10的","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4424762,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/43/84/3a/3d745603.jpg","nickname":"傅聪Cong","note":"","ucode":"83729C2BAD5684","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":678219,"discussion_content":"根据SASREC的论文，他们不是在全部item库上面算Hit，而是为每个正样本配100个随机采样的负样本，所以看起来数字会很高。","content_length":160,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1770641966,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"新加坡","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":4463124,"avatar":"","nickname":"Geek_f61886","note":"","ucode":"656D866FB91889","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":677972,"discussion_content":"29分43秒，有介绍四个数据集的Item数量。3k-57k。","content_length":62,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1770174727,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":407325,"user_name":"YJ-Wu","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2814082,"ip_address":"中国香港","ucode":"0ED1B41F124061","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/2a/f0/82/f235d91d.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1777918083,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101108201,"comment_content":"课件中第9页的SASREC的训练模式一（自回归建模）的阐述中，对于后续多数实现用Cross Entropy(CE)的损失表达，应该是少一个负号了吧？PPT中的写法是真实 item 的 softmax 概率，严格来说 CE Loss 应该是它的负对数，也就是：\\mathcal{L}_{\\mathrm{CE}}=-\\log\\frac{\\exp(s^+)}{\\sum_{j \\in V_{\\text{item}}} \\exp(s_j)}","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":406576,"user_name":"Geek_53ff1a","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":4494736,"ip_address":"","ucode":"D02B6032290E5A","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1775306235,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101108201,"comment_content":"课件在哪里下载呢","like_count":0}]}